extras/c7ccd059a1199dc7f01e5012260c2bc7.mp4?t=1770196620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spikes, TNT, Explosive blocks, Metal Blocks and many other things exist for you to avoid in the many levels of <strong>Shovelware</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetics...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many cosmetics for you to purchase with the Gems you find scattered around the level, Other cosmetics can be unlocked by completing tasks in certain levels.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430030/extras/e73ccc1eca2854aec55f005e9608003e.avif?t=1770196620\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430030/extras_big/e73ccc1eca2854aec55f005e9608003e.avif?t=1770196620 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetics come as Body, Eyes, Head gear and Shovels. They do not affect the gameplay in any way but let you add your own flair to the in game character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 Cosmetics exist, can you find and unlock them all?</p>","developers":["GrindalfGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430030/header.jpg?t=1770196620","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3430030/1319553951/2b3b75925d7a730313a1922b91ac8bf17e032617/1770165519/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770196619","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3430030/1319553951/2b3b75925d7a730313a1922b91ac8bf17e032617/1770165519/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770196619","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3430030/1319553951/2b3b75925d7a730313a1922b91ac8bf17